; A 9x7 outline with radius 2, worked by hand from the midpoint circle of
; radius 2, whose arc is (2,0) (0,2) (2,1) (1,2): each corner loses its
; tip, so rows 0 and 6 run from x 1 to 7 and the sides stand at x 0 and 8.
; The filled copy on frame 2 takes the same rows end to end.
(new 9 7)
(rect-round 0 0 8 6 2 1)
(frame-add)
(rect-round-fill 0 0 8 6 2 2)
